// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - EpisodeOneClue 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue Name :
"P1359879050" "Snake Hunt"
// DetailString :
"P3674045172" "It all started when you met Mongoose on Mercy Island. Mongoose was a professional Snake hunter working for Arachnos, hired to help keep the Snake population down. He got you to help him cull the Snakes on Mercy, giving you a chance to prove your worthiness to Lord Recluse."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - EpisodeTwoClue 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue Name :
"P2258024733" "The Serpent Statue"
// DetailString :
"P182705262" "It all started when you met Mongoose on Mercy Island. Mongoose was a professional Snake hunter working for Arachnos, hired to help keep the Snake population down. He got you to help him cull the Snakes on Mercy, giving you a chance to prove your worthiness to Lord Recluse.<br><br>Mongoose then sent you to clear out a nest of Snakes infesting the sewers underneath Mercy Island. In the Snake lair you found a strange statue on their leader, a  roughly-carved idol in the form of a snake. Returning to Mongoose, he mentioned finding similiar statues in other Snake nests. Supposedly, the Snakes worshipped some sort of 'snake goddess'."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// SouvenirClueDef - SL1_MI_Mongoose_Mini_Arc_Souvenir 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// SouvenirClueDef Name :
"P961745494" "Snakeskin Boots"
// tDetailString :
"P3366682022" "These are a pair of snakeskin boots, given to you by Mongoose on Mercy Island. You received them after you helped him cull the Snake population in a tale you like to call:<br><br>Snake Uprising<br><br>It all started when you met Mongoose on Mercy Island. Mongoose was a professional Snake hunter working for Arachnos, hired to help keep the Snake population down. He got you to help him cull the Snakes on Mercy, giving you a chance to prove your worthiness to Lord Recluse.<br><br>Mongoose then sent you to clear out a nest of Snakes infesting the sewers underneath Mercy Island. In the Snake lair you found a strange statue on their leader, a  roughly-carved idol in the form of a snake. Returning to Mongoose, he mentioned finding similiar statues in other Snake nests. Supposedly, the Snakes worshipped some sort of 'snake goddess'.<br><br>Mongoose received news about the Snakes from a particular pit were staging strikes on specific Arachnos targets. Mongoose believed there was some sort of Snake leader behind these attacks, and sent you to take him down. You entered the Snake pit and discovered in its depths a large Snake temple to their goddess Stheno. You took down their high priest S'thaco and returned to Mongoose for your reward."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Mission_1 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P3188854845" "As you probably noticed, Mercy is literally crawling with Snakes. As far as we can tell, they were once humans who were infected by some kind of virus which transformed them into the monsters you see now. There's probably some sort of big mutant Snake dug in way down beneath Mercy somewhere who infects people with the Snake-virus. At least that's what we speculate, 'cause we ain't found that mutant Snake yet!<br><br>Those beasts are fast and vicious, and some of 'em have a nasty venom that'll sting ya somethin' harsh! Lord Recluse has put a bounty on them, so if you're lookin' to get in good with Arachnos, here's your chance. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>Head over to one of the Snake Pits and take down some Snakes!</A>"
// AcceptString :
"P2956193155" "Cull Snake population"
// SendOffString :
"P2948994175" "Snakes usually stick around pits which lead to their underground lairs. The entrances to these Snake pits can be found all over here in Darwin's Landing, and you might find a couple in the Mercy neighborhood as well. I know there are a few due west and due east of the clocktower. Oh yah, and they mostly come out at night.  Mostly.<br><br>Go. Hunt Snakes!"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P3715656449" "What, you need me to hold your hand? Go take down some snakes!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2695520890" "You have culled enough Snakes!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3883265266" "Huh. Not bad! Don't get too cocky though, 'cause there's far worse than Snakes around the Rogue Isles."
// RandomFameString :
"P1253132182" "{VillainName} sure smacked around those Snakes on Mercy Island!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Mission_2 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P295078059" "Nice work on culling the Snakes in the area! Usually we can keep them confined to the Snake Pits, but occasionally they tunnel or slither their way into other places. Speaking of which, we just got a report of a nest of 'em forming in the sewers underneath Darwin's Landing. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>Go in and clear out the Snake nest before it becomes a problem.</A>"
// AcceptString :
"P1236408223" "Clear out Snake nest"
// SendOffString :
"P745128755" "The snakes have most likely constructed their nest in the deeper part of the sewers."
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P1970536904" "What are you waitin' for? Clear out that Snake nest!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P1152498125" "The fetid stench of the Mercy Island sewers is overwhelming. In the depths of this labyrinth of tunnels lies the Snake nest you've come to clear out."

