// Dialog :
"P3010318254" "You cleared out the nest? Nice work, {VillainName}!<br><br>This snake statue? Yah, we see 'em sometimes in Snake nests. Some sort of 'snake goddess' they worship or something. I tell ya, those Snakes are vicious AND crazy!<br><br>This Snake cult was probably started by the same mutant Snake who transformed those poor suckers in the first place, likely to get them to do her bidding."
